WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:03.139
Your existing experience is the starting point This short

00:00:03.205 --> 00:00:08.086
readiness activity is ungraded It is not a language-proficiency

00:00:08.165 --> 00:00:11.152
test under the Common European Framework of Reference for

00:00:11.178 --> 00:00:16.034
Languages CEFR and it is not an adult-literacy assessment

00:00:16.981 --> 00:00:20.994
Choose what you think before opening the explanation You

00:00:21.047 --> 00:00:25.060
can edit the executive’s calendar Does that alone mean

00:00:25.126 --> 00:00:28.968
you can approve a conflicting appointment A colleague has

00:00:28.994 --> 00:00:32.192
read your message about cover Can you say the

00:00:32.271 --> 00:00:36.757
assignment is accepted How familiar does this work feel
